      "snippet": {
        "text": "A total of 128 teachers from public schools in City S, participated in an online questionnaire regarding their preferences for roles they wish to be augmented by AI in K-12 education: 43 elementary school teachers from grades 1-6, 41 middle school teachers from grades 7-9, and 44 high school teachers from grades 10-12. The participant's gender and teaching experiences are shown in Table 5. An official letter encouraging survey participation was sent to 121 schools selected by the Education Research and Information Institute in City S. Participants voluntarily responded to the call for participation.",
