 as large a sample as possible. as well as the support of both the principal and the administration of the schools included in the research. Our sample contains 77 respondents which give 50.66% of the overall population. \n\nThis study aims to provide an adequate model for testing AI attitudes in K-12 level of education in the Republic of Serbia, among teachers in elementary and secondary schools. That is why this study is a prototype study for a future research study on a larger population -the country size.",
