rom participating teachers. The final version of the questionnaire was well-structured and scientifically sound, comprehensively reflecting the actual status of core variables such as teachers' educational anxiety, work engagement, and occupational well-being in the context of artificial intelligence application. This provided a solid data foundation for subsequent empirical analysis and model testing.",
